    "hidden_direction_control": {
      "description": "F2b_rosi_hidden: same alpha rule, but d is an INDEPENDENT random unit direction per matrix (not s_hat) -- 'preserves ROSI's geometry (one rank-one term per matrix) but not its meaning'.",
      "rng_seed_rule": "np.random.default_rng(SEED + int(mult*1000)), SEED=20260920 (iter_2/gen_art/gen_art_experiment_2/behave2.py:SEED:78); per-matrix draw is rng.standard_normal(d_out) normalised to unit norm",
